(6, 1, '2026-11-07 19:17:08', '2026-11-07 19:17:08', '<label> Nama Anda\n    [text* your-name autocomplete:name] </label>\n\n<label> E-mail anda\n    [email* your-email autocomplete:email] </label>\n\n<label> Subjek\n    [text* your-subject] </label>\n\n<label> Pesan Anda (opsional)\n    [textarea your-message] </label>\n\n[submit \"Kirim\"]\n[_site_title] \"[your-subject]\"\n[_site_title] <n4uf4lk4mil@gmail.com>\nDari: [your-name] [your-email]\nSubjek: [your-subject]\n\nIsi Pesan:\n[your-message]\n\n-- \nIni adalah pemberitahuan bahwa formulir kontak telah dikirimkan di situs web Anda ([_site_title] [_site_url]).\n[_site_admin_email]\nReply-To: [your-email]\n\n0\n0\n\n[_site_title] \"[your-subject]\"\n[_site_title] <n4uf4lk4mil@gmail.com>\nIsi Pesan:\n[your-message]\n\n-- \nEmail ini adalah tanda terima pengiriman formulir kontak Anda di situs web kami ([_site_title] [_site_url]) yang menggunakan alamat email Anda. Jika itu bukan Anda, harap abaikan pesan ini.\n[your-email]\nReply-To: [_site_admin_email]\n\n0\n0\nTerima kasih untuk pesan Anda. Pesan berhasil dikirim\nTerdapat kesalahan dalam mengirim pesan Anda. Silahkan coba lagi nanti\nSatu atau lebih kolom terdapat eror. Harap periksa dan coba lagi.\nTerdapat kesalahan dalam mengirim pesan Anda. Silahkan coba lagi nanti\nAnda harus menerima syarat dan ketentuan sebelum mengirim pesan Anda.\nMohon isi ruas ini.\nRuas ini memiliki input terlalu panjang.\nRuas ini memiliki input terlalu pendek.\nTerdapat kesalahan tidak diketahui saat mengunggah berkas.\nAnda tidak diperbolehkan untuk mengunggah berkas dengan jenis ini.\nBerkas yang diunggah terlalu besar.\nTerdapat kesalahan dalam mengunggah berkas', 'Formulir kontak 1', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'formulir-kontak-1', '', '', '2026-11-07 19:17:08', '2026-11-07 19:17:08', '', 0, 'http://localhost/literasi/?post_type=wpcf7_contact_form&p=6', 0, 'wpcf7_contact_form', '', 0),
(7, 1, '2026-11-08 13:19:23', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '{\n    \"flexify::sidebar_style_category\": {\n        \"value\": \"inherit\",\n        \"type\": \"theme_mod\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-11-08 13:17:06\"\n    },\n    \"flexify::sidebar_widgets_category\": {\n        \"value\": \"inherit\",\n        \"type\": \"theme_mod\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-11-08 13:17:06\"\n    },\n    \"flexify::sidebar_style_tag\": {\n        \"value\": \"inherit\",\n        \"type\": \"theme_mod\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-11-08 13:17:06\"\n    },\n    \"flexify::sidebar_widgets_tag\": {\n        \"value\": \"inherit\",\n        \"type\": \"theme_mod\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-11-08 13:17:06\"\n    },\n    \"flexify::sidebar_style_author\": {\n        \"value\": \"inherit\",\n        \"type\": \"theme_mod\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-11-08 13:17:06\"\n    },\n    \"flexify::sidebar_widgets_author\": {\n        \"value\": \"inherit\",\n        \"type\": \"theme_mod\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-11-08 13:17:06\"\n    },\n    \"flexify::sidebar_style_search\": {\n        \"value\": \"inherit\",\n        \"type\": \"theme_mod\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-11-08 13:17:06\"\n    },\n    \"flexify::sidebar_widgets_search\": {\n        \"value\": \"inherit\",\n        \"type\": \"theme_mod\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-11-08 13:17:06\"\n    },\n    \"blogdescription\": {\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"type\": \"option\",\n        \"user_id\": 1,\n        \"date_modified_gmt\": \"2026-11-08 13:19:23\"\n    }\n}', '', '', 'auto-draft', 'closed', 'closed', '', '032743f4-4d1e-4646-afc9-5f3cabe1576e', '', '', '2026-11-08 13:19:23', '2026-11-08 13:19:23', '', 0, 'http://localhost/literasi/?p=7', 0, 'customize_changeset', '', 0),
